  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and supporting documents and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development: - drawing number (add reference number)dated (date on the plans) - documents entitled (document title) dated (date on the document)",
    "<p>The external brickwork and associated pointing shall match the existing host building in colour, texture, bond and joint profile and shall thereafter be retained as such for the lifetime of the development.</p>",
    "The accommodation hereby approved shall be used solely for purposes ancillary to the residential occupation of the ground floor flat at No. 119 Chewton Road and shall remain part of that dwelling. It shall not be occupied or let as a separate dwelling or otherwise used as an independent residential unit.Reason: To ensure that the accommodation remains part of the existing dwelling and to prevent the creation of a separate residential unit that has not been assessed under this permission, in accordance with Policies 53 and 56 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024).",
    "Before the accommodation hereby approved is first brought into use, the internal corridor and connecting doorway shown on drawing 070-100-01 Revision B shall be provided. This internal connection shall thereafter be retained and kept available for access between the approved accommodation and the host flat.Reason: To secure the functional integration of the accommodation with the existing dwelling, in accordance with Policies 53 and 56 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024)."
  ],
